### Onix Memo API Test (VS Code Optimized)

# @name createUserA
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-a@test.com",
  "password": "password-a"
}

###

# @name loginA
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-a@test.com",
  "password": "password-a"
}

###

# @name createMemoA
POST http://localhost:3000/memos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "title": "A의 비밀 메모",
  "content": "이 내용은 보호되어야 합니다."
}

###

# @name createConflictMemo
POST http://localhost:3000/memos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "title": "Conflict Test Memo",
  "content": "Original content"
}

### [정상 업데이트]
POST http://localhost:3000/memos/push
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "pushedMemos": [
    {
      "id": "{{createConflictMemo.response.body.id}}",
      "title": "Updated",
      "content": "New content",
      "version": 2,
      "baseVersion": {{createConflictMemo.response.body.version}},
      "createdAt": "2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-10T00:01:00.000Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    }
  ]
}

### [충돌 테스트]
POST http://localhost:3000/memos/push
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "pushedMemos": [
    {
      "id": "{{createConflictMemo.response.body.id}}",
      "title": "Conflict!",
      "content": "Rejected content",
      "version": 2,
      "baseVersion": {{createConflictMemo.response.body.version}},
      "createdAt": "2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-10T00:02:00.000Z",
      "deletedAt": null
    }
  ]
}

### [히스토리 조회]
GET http://localhost:3000/memos/{{createConflictMemo.response.body.id}}/histories
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.access_token}}